4.2 Woodchucks
Woodchucks (included as a joke with the Oracle) are never generated, ever. 
Most other monsters have specific conditions under which you can create them 
(queen bees only appear in beehives and in the wizard tower), but woodchucks 
are not created, ever. Thus, if you really want to kill them, you have to 
either genocide or reverse genocide them.

The only way you may ever see a woodchuck in your game is if a monster steps 
on a polymorph trap (accidently or deliberately) and randomly becomes one.

